  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        524.3753662109375,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "recommendations, this endpoint was ranked by the GDG as important but not critical for decision-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        299.2107849121094,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "making and was not part of the systematic review.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        102.29462432861328,
        527.4330444335938,
        116.73762512207031
      ],
      "text": "For new patients without HIV infection, high- certainty of evidence demonstrated no significant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4189453125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "difference between regimens that were administered daily throughout treatment, daily initially and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        456.8406982421875,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "then intermittently in the continuation phase, or thrice weekly throughout treatment.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        150.3986358642578,
        527.3524780273438,
        164.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "Daily dosing is optimal because it probably achieves better adherence under programme conditions.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99379825592041,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        163.59864807128906,
        527.4365234375,
        178.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "While the definition of the term varies across countries, “daily” is considered to mean at least five",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        176.79859924316406,
        527.427734375,
        191.24159240722656
      ],
      "text": "times per week. In addition, meta-analyses showed the superiority of daily (compared with thrice",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        189.99855041503906,
        527.503662109375,
        204.44154357910156
      ],
      "text": "weekly) intensive-phase dosing for patients with pre-treatment isoniazid resistance and for preventing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972465515136719,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19850158691406,
        269.2566223144531,
        217.64149475097656
      ],
      "text": "acquired drug resistance in patients overall.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.99171447753906,
        228.9477081298828,
        251.87171936035156
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 1.3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        263.5771484375,
        203.97349548339844,
        277.93212890625
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        285.19171142578125,
        492.97210693359375,
        299.54669189453125
      ],
      "text": "1.3 In all patients with drug-susceptible pulmonary TB, the use of thrice-weekly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        297.19171142578125,
        499.9998779296875,
        311.54669189453125
      ],
      "text": "dosing is not recommended in both the intensive and continuation phases of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        309.19171142578125,
        466.18597412109375,
        323.54669189453125
      ],
      "text": "therapy and daily dosing remains the recommended dosing frequency",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.48127746582031,
        325.4436340332031,
        423.3435363769531,
        339.7986145019531
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.67413330078125,
        220.7113037109375,
        372.526123046875
      ],
      "text": "Source of recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.7340087890625,
        527.437744140625,
        394.1770324707031
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation was first put forward in 2010 and then updated in the 2017 guidelines (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.82403564453125,
        527.4287719726562,
        407.3770446777344
      ],
      "text": "Annex 1 summary of recommendations in  ). It is copied without modification into this consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        406.1340026855469,
        330.9513244628906,
        420.5770263671875
      ],
      "text": "document and appears exactly as in the 2010 guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        433.95123291015625,
        216.29168701171875,
        449.80322265625
      ],
      "text": "Justification and evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.0111999511719,
        527.43994140625,
        471.4542236328125
      ],
      "text": "The use of intermittent dosing of TB medications has been adopted in some geographical settings",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.21112060546875,
        527.3947143554688,
        484.6541442871094
      ],
      "text": "in an effort to improve treatment adherence and to reduce the burden on the health-care system",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        483.41119384765625,
        527.4212646484375,
        497.8542175292969
      ],
      "text": "due to daily treatment support. However, it was unclear how this intermittent dosing might affect",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        496.6112060546875,
        527.3485717773438,
        511.0542297363281
      ],
      "text": "treatment outcomes. In addition to the evidence from a systematic review conducted in 2009 of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.53521728515625,
        527.43505859375,
        524.2542114257812
      ],
      "text": "(7) treatment regimens with intermittent dosing schedules  , this systematic review was updated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.7352294921875,
        203.30470275878906,
        537.4542236328125
      ],
      "text": "(11–17) the most recent RCTs  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.715087890625,
        527.3935546875,
        559.1580810546875
      ],
      "text": "Evidence showed that when thrice-weekly dosing throughout therapy was compared to daily dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        557.9151000976562,
        527.3418579101562,
        572.3580932617188
      ],
      "text": "throughout therapy, patients who received thrice-weekly dosing had a higher risk of treatment failure,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980632781982422,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.1151123046875,
        527.4278564453125,
        585.55810546875
      ],
      "text": "disease relapse and acquired drug resistance in both drug-susceptible disease and when the strain",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.3151245117188,
        527.4309692382812,
        598.7581176757812
      ],
      "text": "susceptibility was unknown. Consequently, thrice-weekly dosing in the intensive phase should never",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.51513671875,
        109.90509033203125,
        611.9581298828125
      ],
      "text": "be used.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.218994140625,
        527.3948364257812,
        633.6619873046875
      ],
      "text": "Likewise, when thrice-weekly dosing during the continuation phase only is compared to daily dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.4191284179688,
        527.4408569335938,
        646.8621215820312
      ],
      "text": "throughout, there were higher rates of treatment failure and relapse in the patients that received",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.6190185546875,
        527.4013671875,
        660.06201171875
      ],
      "text": "thrice-weekly treatment during the continuation phase. In this case, acquired drug resistance rates",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.8189697265625,
        527.39599609375,
        673.261962890625
      ],
      "text": "did not differ. If thrice-weekly dosing during the continuation phase is used, it is essential to make",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        672.01904296875,
        503.771240234375,
        686.4620361328125
      ],
      "text": "sure that patients do not miss any dose of the medications and that treatment support is used.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        693.7230224609375,
        524.51220703125,
        708.166015625
      ],
      "text": "In this review, the use of twice-weekly dosing in the continuation phase only was also reviewed. Twice-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977627754211426,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.9229736328125,
        527.3936767578125,
        721.365966796875
      ],
      "text": "weekly dosing in the continuation phase only had higher rates of treatment failure, disease relapse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.1229858398438,
        527.4890747070312,
        734.5659790039062
      ],
      "text": "and drug resistance than thrice-weekly dosing in the continuation phase only. As a result, twice-weekly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965947151184082,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.322998046875,
        343.8344421386719,
        747.7659912109375
      ],
      "text": "dosing should never be used during any part of TB therapy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "10 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
